msgctxt "#30055"
msgid "Color palette to be used. If 'Custom' is selected, the palette used will be taken from the 'custom.pal' file placed in the RetroArch System/BIOS directory."
msgstr "要使用的颜色调色板。如果选择“自定义”，则调色板将从放置在 RetroArch System/BIOS 目录中的 'custom.pal' 文件中读取。"

msgctxt "#30056"
msgid "CXA2025AS (US)"
msgstr "CXA2025AS（美版）"

